{"title":"Adding Unassigned Calendars to Groups","category":"Calendars & Appointments","categorySlug":"calendars-appointments","folder":"Calendar Groups","html":"<p><span><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yN1yhrhrmMA?&amp;wmode=opaque\" title=\"Video\"></iframe></span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>You can now assign Groups to the <strong>Unassigned Calendar</strong> type as well as other <strong>Round-robin</strong> Calendars</p><p><br/></p><p>Go to <strong>Settings&gt; Calendars:</strong><br/><strong><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48275919878/original/gUC1FoTf1TkFGD4EjVwNtoSiNONwucJNGw.png?1673969124\"/></strong></p><p><br/></p><p>Click on the <strong>3 dots</strong> on the right side of the desired Calendar and then click on <strong>Move to Group</strong>:</p><p><br/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48275920143/original/IaGc2orq1dFPZYTiaRHLr7vXXpmjMra8hA.png?1673969175\"/></p><p>It would open a pop-up where you would be asked to select a group you want to assign to the calendar and then Click on <strong>Select</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48275920666/original/1F0J1bCyUySo4ajbnqGnMjKzfasxNqZjOw.png?1673969263\"/></p>","updated":"Wed, 14 May, 2025 at 10:18 AM"}